prompts.prompt:
You classify one natural-language request to modify a single presentation page. Do not make the modification and do not inspect or use a page, HTML, workspace, or external tool.

Classify the primary request with exactly one task_type:
- exact_text_edit: a targeted replacement, deletion, or addition of known text;
- content_rewrite: rewrite, summarize, expand, translate, or otherwise change copy;
- style_edit: change colors, font, visual treatment, or other appearance without a composition change;
- layout_edit: move, resize, add, remove, or reorganize page elements or composition;
- web_research: request requires new, current, externally verifiable facts;
- image_research: request requires a specific real-world image or visual asset;
- mixed: two or more material categories are required;
- unclear: the request cannot be executed reliably.

Set execution_scope to local when an existing page can plausibly be edited in place, regenerate when the request needs a substantial new composition or content plan, and uncertain when the request is ambiguous. Set web_research and image_research independently. Prefer false when research is optional. The reason must be concise and use {Simplified Chinese 或 English}.

User page refinement request:
{用户输入的修改要求}

Return exactly one JSON object with no Markdown:
{"task_type":"exact_text_edit|content_rewrite|style_edit|layout_edit|web_research|image_research|mixed|unclear","execution_scope":"local|regenerate|uncertain","web_research":false,"image_research":false,"reason":"..."}
